# --- Generated media (screenshots / photos / face data / QR / AI images) ---
# Jarvis ke saare screenshots, camera photos, face enrollment samples,
# QR codes, aur AI-generated images ab EK hi folder mein save hote hain
# (config.MEDIA_DIR = "jarvis_media"), root mein bikhre hue nahi. Poora
# folder yahan ignore hai, isliye "khud ko GitHub pe update kar do"
# (push_update) bolne pe ye kabhi upload nahi hoga - sirf code jaayega.
jarvis_media/
# Purane naam se koi stray file reh gayi ho (safety net):
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# --- Build / venv / editor / large local-only stuff ---
build/
dist/
*.spec.bak
.vscode/
.idea/
node_modules/

# --- "work" folder: sab client/project files (html, png, jpg, pdf, docx,
# koi bhi non-Jarvis-code file) yahan rakho. Ye poora folder git se
# COMPLETELY ignore hai - isme jo bhi ho, wo kabhi commit/push/pull mein
# touch nahi hota, isliye "local changes overwritten by merge" jaisi
# error kabhi nahi aayegi. Jarvis ka asli code (skills/, *.py, etc.) is
# folder ke bahar hi rehta hai jaisa pehle se hai.
work/

# --- Safety net: agar kabhi koi generated/project file "work/" ke bahar
# root ya kisi skill folder mein galti se bach jaaye, ye bhi ignore
# rahenge taaki wo bhi kabhi git conflict na de.
*.html
*.pdf
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.pptx
